cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Robocon 2025 Robot Basketball: Dual-Robot Control Software"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Robocon 2025 Team"
abstract: >-
  Dual-robot software stack for ABU Robocon 2025 Robot Basketball.
  R1 (offense) runs ROS Noetic field-centric drive with active heading
  lock and FreeRTOS encoder odometry. R2 (defense) runs bare-metal
  Arduino Due firmware with 3-wheel omni IK and encoder-gated net deployment.
keywords:
  - ABU Robocon
  - ROS Noetic
  - omnidirectional drive
  - FreeRTOS
  - ESP32
  - Arduino Due
  - active heading lock
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-04-08"
